      "title": "🔍 Guide: 4K Supersampled Panorama Upscaler (RealESRGAN 4x -> 4K Anti-Alias)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 🛡️ 4K Supersampling Anti-Aliasing Workflow\n\nSolve the \"dotted / noisy artifacts\" dilemma when upscaling with RealESRGAN 4×!\n\n---\n\n### 🔬 Why Supersampling ($2K \\to 8K \\to 4K$)?\n• **Problem**: RealESRGAN 4× (`RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth`) produces exceptional structural sharpness and architectural definition, but can generate single-pixel speckled / dotted high-frequency artifacts when viewed at native 8K ($8192 \\times 4096$).\n• **Solution**: By upscaling to 8K and immediately downsampling to **4K ($4096 \\times 2048$)**, the 4-pixel grid is integrated into a single ultra-clean pixel. This **crushes single-pixel dotted noise and artifacts** while preserving the razor-sharp geometry generated by the 4× model!\n\n---\n\n### 🎛️ 3 Selectable Downsampling Filters\nTest and compare all three reconstruction filters in **[Qwen 360 Panorama Downsample]**:\n\n1. **`area` (Recommended)**:\n   • Pixel box averaging filter (`torch.nn.functional.interpolate` in `area` mode).\n   • **Optimal for removing dotted artifacts**: Integrates the 4× pixel footprint into a smooth average, eliminating noise without ringing or edge haloing.\n\n2. **`bicubic`**:\n   • High-order antialiased bicubic filter.\n   • Softens transitions naturally, producing cinematic photorealism.\n\n3. **`lanczos`**:\n   • 3-lobe windowed sinc filter.\n   • Maximum sharpness retention, preserving micro-contrast and crisp line edges.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 100% Toroidal Seam Free\nBoth the 4× Upscaler and the Downsampler use **5% toroidal boundary wrapping** across the $0^\\circ / 360^\\circ$ boundary, ensuring zero vertical stitch line artifacts."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# 🛡️ 4K Supersampling Anti-Aliasing Workflow\n\n• **Pipeline**: 2K -> 8K (RealESRGAN 4x) -> 4K (Anti-Alias Downsample)\n• **Filters**: area (best for dotted artifacts), bicubic, lanczos\n• **Toroidal Seam Fix**: Zero stitch lines across 360 wrap"
      },
      "color": "#1d2e3f",
      "bgcolor": "#121d2b"
    },
